cefully pressing the strings, capturing the emotion of the music.\n\nThe background reveals crashing waves with foamy white crests hitting dark, moss-covered rocks, spray mist lingering in the air. The horizon is painted with the warm hues of a setting sun—burnt orange, violet, and soft pink—reflecting off the wet sand and the polished wood of the cello. Seagulls are visible as tiny silhouettes in the distance.\n\nThe lighting is dramatic and volumetric, with the low sun providing a strong rim light that outlines her silhouette and the curves of the cello, creating a halo effect against the darkening sea. The scene is shot with an 85mm prime lens at f/1.8 for a shallow depth of field, keeping her and the cello in razor-sharp focus while the ocean background blurs into a painterly bokeh. High-resolution textures capture the grain of the wood, the rosin dust on the strings, the weave of the silk dress, and individual strands of hair. 8k resolution, photorealistic, ray-tracing, cinematic color grading, emotional atmosphere."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 200, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335533", "size": [371.5047607421875, 583.5789184570312], "pos": [-2505.016845703125, -183.69395446777344], "id": 84, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [41], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["A hyper-realistic, cinematic masterpiece depicting an epic cosmic battle between a fluffy, heroic Superman kitten and a 3D-rendered, textured version of Crayon Shin-chan. The Superman kitten, a British Shorthair with soft grey fur, is wearing a miniature, high-quality textured blue spandex suit with the